<title>USA: West Coast Bancorp sets stock split.</title>
<headline>West Coast Bancorp sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE OSWEGO, Ore. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Coast Bancorp Wednesday said its board of directors declared a stock split in the form of a 25 percent dividend.</p>
<p>Shareholders will be issued one additional share for each four shares currently outstanding, to be paid to shareholders of record Oct. 7, and distributed Oct. 30.</p>
<p>The company also announced that the board of directors declared a cash dividend on the post-split shares of $0.06 per share, payable Oct. 31 to shareholders of record Oct. 9.</p>
<p>This represents an increase of 15 percent from the prior cash dividends of $0.052 per share.</p>
</text>
